# GOWIN IDE rewrites rtl/ file paths to absolute WSL UNC paths on every save.
# The 'gowinpath' clean filter normalizes them back to repo-relative on commit.
# Filter definition lives in local .git/config (see README / setup below):
#   git config filter.gowinpath.clean "sed -E 's#path=\"[^\"]*/(rtl/[^\"]*)\"#path=\"../../../\\1\"#'"
fpga/gowin/*/*.gprj filter=gowinpath
